  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup almond flour (blanched)",
    "2 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "1/4 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "2 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "2 large egg",
    "4 tablespoon unsalted butter",
    "2 tablespoon pumpkin puree",
    "1/2 teaspoon liquid stevia",
    "2 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "1 teaspoon sour cream",
    "1 teaspoon maple extract",
    "1/4 teaspoon liquid stevia",
    "2 teaspoon heavy cream"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prepare all the ingredients. Preheat oven to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together the dry ingredients in a bowl: almond flour, coconut flour, stevia/erythritol blend, allspice, baking powder, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, mix together the wet ingredients: melted butter, eggs, pumpkin puree, and liquid stevia. Mix until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients and mix together until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, with a hand mixer whip the softened cream cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sour cream and mix.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the maple extract, liquid stevia, and heavy cream. Mix together until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a muffin pan with cupcake liners. Fill half of the cupcake liner with the pumpkin muffin mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the maple cream cheese mixture on top of this.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, add more of the pumpkin batter. Then, top with the maple cream cheese mixture again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "With a toothpick, mix these together creating a swirl. Then, place in the oven for 25-30 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Maple-Cream-Cheese-Pumpkin-Muffins-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "A toothpick inserted into the muffin should come out clean when done. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-maple-cream-cheese-pumpkin-muffins/#wprm-recipe-53709-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
